msgid "Run status."
msgstr "运行状态。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:67
msgid "Lowercase SHA-256 hex digest from the result."
msgstr "来自结果的小写 SHA-256 十六进制摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:67 ../../site/api/risk.md:70
msgid "Specification echoed from the result."
msgstr "从结果回显的模型设定。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:67 ../../site/api/risk.md:70
msgid "Forecast events; empty for non-ok reports."
msgstr "预测事件；非 ok 报告为空。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:67 ../../site/api/risk.md:70
msgid "Refit parameters; empty for non-ok reports."
msgstr "重新拟合参数；非 ok 报告为空。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:67 ../../site/api/risk.md:70
msgid "Report diagnostics."
msgstr "报告诊断信息。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:67
msgid "Whether backtest holds a backtest."
msgstr "backtest 字段是否包含回测结果。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:67
msgid "Backtest payload; meaningful only when has_backtest is true."
msgstr "回测载荷；仅当 has_backtest 为 true 时有意义。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:67 ../../site/api/risk.md:70
msgid "Basel zone; empty without a backtest."
msgstr "巴塞尔分区；没有回测时为空。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:67
msgid "Optional index label supplied to the builder."
msgstr "传给构建器的可选索引标签。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:67
msgid "Optional index timezone label; the native builder leaves it empty."
msgstr "可选的索引时区标签；原生构建器保持其为空。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:67 ../../site/api/risk.md:70
msgid "Basel reference disclosure text."
msgstr "巴塞尔参考披露文本。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:67 ../../site/api/risk.md:70
msgid "Report schema version."
msgstr "报告模式版本。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:70
msgid "Native detached dictionary projection of risk_validation_report."
msgstr "risk_validation_report 的原生独立字典投影。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:70
msgid ""
"This is the C++ equivalent of the source's JSON-compatible to_dict mapping: "
"every native report field is represented exactly once. Python object "
"identity and mapping subclassing are not claimed."
msgstr ""
"这是源实现中与 JSON 兼容的 to_dict 映射在 C++ 中的等价物：每个原生报告字段都恰好出现一次。不声称具备 Python 的对象身份或 "
"mapping 子类化。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:70
msgid "Status name: ok, insufficient_data, or unsupported."
msgstr "状态名称：ok、insufficient_data 或 unsupported。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:70
msgid "Lowercase SHA-256 hex digest from the walk-forward result."
msgstr "来自滚动前向结果的小写 SHA-256 十六进制摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:70
msgid "Optional index label."
msgstr "可选的索引标签。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:70
msgid "Optional index timezone label; not populated by the native builder."
msgstr "可选的索引时区标签；原生构建器不会填充。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:70
msgid "Backtest payload; empty when the report has no backtest."
msgstr "回测载荷；报告没有回测时为空。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:73
msgid "Result of a walk-forward VaR run."
msgstr "一次滚动前向 VaR 运行的结果。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:73
msgid "Specification used to produce the result."
msgstr "产生该结果所使用的模型设定。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:73
msgid "Out-of-sample timestamps; empty unless status is ok."
msgstr "样本外时间戳；除非状态为 ok 否则为空。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:73
msgid "VaR forecast path aligned with index; empty unless status is ok."
msgstr "与 index 对齐的 VaR 预测路径；除非状态为 ok 否则为空。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:73
msgid "Realized returns aligned with index; empty unless status is ok."
msgstr "与 index 对齐的实现收益率；除非状态为 ok 否则为空。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:73
msgid "Timestamps of all refits; the first equals index.front() when ok."
msgstr "所有重新拟合的时间戳；状态为 ok 时第一个等于 index.front()。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:73
msgid "Parameters recorded for each refit, one per refit_timestamps entry."
msgstr "为每次重新拟合记录的参数，与 refit_timestamps 的条目一一对应。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:73
msgid ""
"Lowercase SHA-256 hex digest of the input values and the confidence level, "
"window, refit cadence, distribution and model version."
msgstr "输入取值以及置信水平、窗口、重新拟合节奏、分布与模型版本的小写 SHA-256 十六进制摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:73
msgid "Reason for an unsupported or insufficient_data result; empty for ok."
msgstr "unsupported 或 insufficient_data 结果的原因；ok 时为空。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:73
msgid "Number of input observations."
msgstr "输入观测数量。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:73
msgid "Out-of-sample VaR backtest; meaningful only when has_backtest is true."
msgstr "样本外 VaR 回测；仅当 has_backtest 为 true 时有意义。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:73
msgid "Whether backtest was populated."
msgstr "backtest 是否被填充。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:76
msgid "Extreme-value model used for a tail estimate."
msgstr "用于尾部估计的极值模型。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:76 ../../site/api/risk.md:79 ../../site/api/risk.md:82
#: ../../site/api/risk.md:85 ../../site/api/risk.md:88 ../../site/api/risk.md:91
#: ../../site/api/risk.md:94 ../../site/api/risk.md:97 ../../site/api/risk.md:100
#: ../../site/api/risk.md:103 ../../site/api/risk.md:106
#: ../../site/api/risk.md:109
msgid "Values:"
msgstr "取值："

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:76
msgid "Peaks-over-threshold generalized Pareto model."
msgstr "超阈值 Peaks-over-threshold 推广 Pareto 模型。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:76
msgid "Block-maxima generalized extreme-value model."
msgstr "分块极大值推广极值模型。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:79
msgid "Tail of the return distribution used by an EVT model."
msgstr "EVT 模型使用的收益率分布尾部。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:79
msgid "Lower tail (losses)."
msgstr "下尾（亏损）。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:79
msgid "Upper tail (gains)."
msgstr "上尾（盈利）。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:82
msgid "GARCH-family model selected by the convenience functions."
msgstr "便捷函数所选用的 GARCH 家族模型。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:82
msgid "GARCH(1,1) with a zero mean."
msgstr "零均值的 GARCH(1,1)。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:82
msgid "EGARCH(1,1)."
msgstr "EGARCH(1,1)。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:82
msgid "GJR-GARCH(1,1) with an asymmetric shock term."
msgstr "带非对称冲击项的 GJR-GARCH(1,1)。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:85
msgid "Estimation method for a generalized Pareto fit."
msgstr "推广 Pareto 拟合的估计方法。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:85
msgid "Maximum-likelihood fit of the GPD."
msgstr "GPD 的极大似然拟合。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:85
msgid "Probability-weighted-moment fit using L-moments."
msgstr "使用 L 矩的概率加权矩拟合。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:88
msgid "Risk measure exercised by a backtest."
msgstr "回测所检验的风险度量。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:88
msgid "Value-at-risk exception backtest."
msgstr "VaR 突破回测。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:88
msgid "Expected-shortfall backtest."
msgstr "期望损失回测。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:91
msgid "Classification of a VaR or ES backtest."
msgstr "VaR 或 ES 回测的分类结果。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:91
msgid "Coverage tests do not reject the model and the sample is adequate."
msgstr "覆盖率检验不拒绝模型，且样本量充足。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:91
msgid "A coverage test rejects the model and the sample is adequate."
msgstr "某项覆盖率检验拒绝模型，且样本量充足。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:91
msgid ""
"Fewer than three paired observations or fewer than five expected exceptions;"
" the sample is too small to test."
msgstr "配对观测少于三个，或预期突破数少于五；样本过小无法检验。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:91
msgid "Experimental backtest; used by the ES bootstrap path."
msgstr "实验性回测；ES 自助法路径使用。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:94
msgid "Distribution labels for walk-forward VaR."
msgstr "滚动前向 VaR 的分布标签。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:94
msgid "Empirical distribution using the Weibull quantile."
msgstr "使用 Weibull 分位数的经验分布。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:94
msgid "Normal distribution using the mean and sample deviation."
msgstr "使用均值与样本标准差的正态分布。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:97
msgid "Completion status of a risk estimate."
msgstr "风险估计的完成状态。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:97
msgid "At least two non-NaN observations were available and any GARCH fit converged."
msgstr "至少有两个非 NaN 观测可用，且任何 GARCH 拟合都已收敛。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:97
msgid "Fewer than two non-NaN observations were available."
msgstr "可用的非 NaN 观测少于两个。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:97
msgid "The GARCH fit did not converge or failed its stationarity checks."
msgstr "GARCH 拟合未收敛或未通过平稳性检查。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:100
msgid "Risk-estimation method used by forecast_var and forecast_es."
msgstr "forecast_var 与 forecast_es 使用的风险估计方法。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:100
msgid "Historical quantile and tail-mean estimate."
msgstr "历史分位数与尾部均值估计。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:100
msgid "Extreme-value estimate using the configured EVT kernel."
msgstr "使用所配置 EVT 内核的极值估计。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:100
msgid "GARCH-family conditional estimate."
msgstr "GARCH 家族的条件估计。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:103
msgid "Target risk measure produced by a forecast."
msgstr "预测所生成的目标风险度量。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:103
msgid "Value at risk."
msgstr "在险价值。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:103
msgid "Expected shortfall."
msgstr "期望损失。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:103
msgid "Pair target label for cross-component metadata."
msgstr "跨组件元数据使用的配对目标标签。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:106
msgid "Tail of the return distribution used by a risk model."
msgstr "风险模型使用的收益率分布尾部。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:106
msgid "Lower (loss) tail."
msgstr "下尾（亏损）。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:106
msgid "Upper (gain) tail."
msgstr "上尾（盈利）。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:109
msgid "Completion status of a walk-forward VaR run."
msgstr "滚动前向 VaR 运行的完成状态。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:109
msgid "Forecast path and backtest were produced."
msgstr "已生成预测路径与回测。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:109
msgid "Fewer observations than one full window plus one."
msgstr "观测数不足一个完整窗口加一。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:109
msgid "The specification combination is not supported."
msgstr "该设定组合不受支持。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:112
msgid "Runs an experimental bootstrap expected-shortfall backtest."
msgstr "运行实验性的自助法期望损失回测。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:112
msgid ""
"The realized tail contains realized values strictly below the linear 1 - "
"confidence_level quantile; realized ES is the tail mean and forecast ES the "
"aligned forecast mean. A seeded bootstrap of the tail supplies the standard "
"deviation of resampled tail means used in the reported z-score. The status "
"is always experimental, and the Kupiec and Christoffersen fields are neutral"
" (0 and 1)."
msgstr ""
"实现尾部包含严格低于线性 1 - confidence_level 分位数的实现值；realized ES 为尾部均值，forecast ES "
"为对齐的预测均值。带种子的尾部自助法给出重抽样尾部均值的样本标准差，用于所报告的 z 值。状态始终为 experimental，Kupiec 与 "
"Christoffersen 字段取中性值（0 与 1）。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:115
msgid "Runs a VaR exception backtest on aligned forecast and realized series."
msgstr "在对齐的预测与实现序列上运行 VaR 突破回测。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:115
msgid ""
"Both frames are aligned on their common timestamps, and pairs with a NaN "
"forecast or realized value are dropped. An exception is a realized value "
"strictly below the forecast. The result is inconclusive when there are fewer"
" than three paired observations or fewer than five expected exceptions; "
"otherwise it is fail when either coverage p-value is below significance and "
"pass otherwise."
msgstr ""
"两个帧按共同时间戳对齐，预测或实现值为 NaN 的配对被丢弃。突破指实现值严格低于预测值。当配对观测少于三个或预期突破数少于五时结果为 "
"inconclusive；否则任一覆盖率 p 值低于 significance 时为 fail，其余为 pass。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:118
msgid "Classifies an exception count into a Basel traffic-light zone."
msgstr "将突破次数划分到巴塞尔红绿灯分区。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:118
msgid ""
"Zones are determined from binomial quantiles at 95% (green/yellow boundary) "
"and 99.99% (yellow/red boundary) for the expected exception probability. "
"Returns green when observations is zero."
msgstr "分区依据预期突破概率下二项分布的 95% 分位（绿/黄边界）与 99.99% 分位（黄/红边界）确定。observations 为零时返回 green。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:121
msgid "Builds a validation report from a walk-forward VaR result."
msgstr "由滚动前向 VaR 结果构建验证报告。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:121
msgid ""
"The result is revalidated before projection: the forecast, realized and "
"index lengths must agree, refit timestamps must follow the specification "
"cadence, fit parameters must reproduce their forecast segments, the digest "
"must be lowercase SHA-256 hex, and the backtest must match a recomputation "
"over the path. The report owns copies of all projected fields."
msgstr ""
"投影之前会重新校验结果：预测、实现与索引的长度必须一致，重新拟合时间戳必须符合设定的节奏，拟合参数必须能复现其预测区段，摘要必须为小写 SHA-256 "
"十六进制，且回测必须与在路径上的重新计算结果一致。报告持有所投影字段的全部副本。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:124
msgid "Returns the Christoffersen independence likelihood-ratio statistic."
msgstr "返回 Christoffersen 独立性似然比统计量。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:124
msgid ""
"Flags are treated as binary; non-zero entries count as exceptions. Returns "
"zero when fewer than two flags are supplied."
msgstr "标志按二值处理；非零项计为突破。提供的标志少于两个时返回零。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:127
msgid ""
"Computes a conditional normal expected shortfall from a GARCH-family "
"variance forecast."
msgstr "由 GARCH 家族方差预测计算条件正态期望损失。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:127
msgid ""
"The fit is performed by forecast_volatility; the value is -sqrt(sum(forecast"
" variances)) * pdf(z(alpha)) / alpha over the requested horizon."
msgstr ""
"拟合由 forecast_volatility 完成；数值为在请求的预测期上 -sqrt(sum(forecast variances)) * "
"pdf(z(alpha)) / alpha。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:130
msgid "Computes a conditional normal VaR from a GARCH-family variance forecast."
msgstr "由 GARCH 家族方差预测计算条件正态 VaR。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:130
msgid ""
"The fit is performed by forecast_volatility; the value is z(alpha) * "
"sqrt(sum(forecast variances)) over the requested horizon."
msgstr ""
"拟合由 forecast_volatility 完成；数值为在请求的预测期上 z(alpha) * sqrt(sum(forecast "
"variances))。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:133
msgid "Returns the relative realized-versus-forecast expected-shortfall score."
msgstr "返回实现与预测期望损失的相对差值度量。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:133
msgid ""
"Realized ES is the mean of realized values at or below the linear 1 - "
"confidence_level quantile, and is zero when that tail is empty. The score is"
" (realized_es - forecast_es) / abs(forecast_es)."
msgstr ""
"realized ES 为不高于线性 1 - confidence_level 分位数的实现值均值，该尾部为空时取零。度量为 (realized_es "
"- forecast_es) / abs(forecast_es)。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:136
msgid "Estimates the conditional tail expectation with an extreme-value model."
msgstr "用极值模型估计条件尾部期望。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:136
msgid ""
"Uses the same fitting and threshold policy as evt_var, then reports the mean"
" of the tail beyond VaR (CVaR/ES). The estimate is signed by tail and lies "
"further into the selected tail than the corresponding VaR."
msgstr ""
"使用与 evt_var 相同的拟合与阈值策略，随后报告超出 VaR 的尾部均值（CVaR/ES）。估计值按尾部符号表示，且比对应的 VaR "
"更靠近所选尾部。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:139
msgid "Estimates the value at risk with an extreme-value model."
msgstr "用极值模型估计在险价值。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:139
msgid ""
"alpha is the tail probability, not the confidence level: for example 0.05 "
"targets the 95% tail. The GPD path fits a peaks-over-threshold model; when "
"threshold is empty, a threshold is chosen to leave enough strict exceedances"
" to cover alpha, starting from the 90th percentile of the selected tail. The"
" GEV path uses block maxima and ignores threshold. The result is signed by "
"tail, so lower-tail estimates are negative."
msgstr ""
"alpha 是尾部概率而非置信水平：例如 0.05 对应 95% 的尾部。GPD 路径拟合 Peaks-over-threshold "
"模型；threshold 为空时，从所选尾部的第 90 百分位开始选择一个能提供足够严格超出值以覆盖 alpha 的阈值。GEV "
"路径使用分块极大值并忽略 threshold。结果按尾部符号表示，因此下尾估计为负。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:142
msgid "Returns the expected number of VaR exceptions."
msgstr "返回预期的 VaR 突破次数。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:142
msgid "The expected count is observations * (1 - confidence_level)."
msgstr "预期次数为 observations * (1 - confidence_level)。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:145
msgid "Estimates VaR, CVaR and fitted tail parameters with an extreme-value model."
msgstr "用极值模型估计 VaR、CVaR 及拟合的尾部参数。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:145
msgid ""
"Runs the same fit and threshold policy as evt_var and evt_cvar and returns "
"both estimates. For GPD, threshold and n_exceedances describe the fit and "
"the location, scale and block fields are empty. For GEV, the location, scale"
" and block fields are set, while threshold is NaN and n_exceedances is zero."
msgstr ""
"运行与 evt_var 和 evt_cvar 相同的拟合与阈值策略并返回两个估计。对 GPD，threshold 与 n_exceedances "
"描述拟合，而 location、scale 与 block 字段为空。对 GEV，location、scale 与 block 字段被设置，而 "
"threshold 为 NaN、n_exceedances 为零。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:148
msgid "Fits an EGARCH(1,1) model by Gaussian maximum likelihood."
msgstr "用高斯极大似然拟合 EGARCH(1,1) 模型。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:148 ../../site/api/risk.md:154
msgid ""
"NaN observations are dropped; at least ten non-NaN observations with finite "
"values and positive variance are required. The fit uses multi-start Nelder-"
"Mead optimization."
msgstr "丢弃 NaN 观测；至少需要十个取值有限且方差为正的 non-NaN 观测。拟合使用多起点 Nelder-Mead 优化。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:151
msgid "Fits a GARCH(1,1) model by Gaussian maximum likelihood."
msgstr "用高斯极大似然拟合 GARCH(1,1) 模型。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:151
msgid ""
"NaN observations are dropped; at least eleven non-NaN observations with "
"finite values and positive variance are required. A zero mean is imposed "
"unless constant_mean is true."
msgstr "丢弃 NaN 观测；至少需要十一个取值有限且方差为正的 non-NaN 观测。除非 constant_mean 为 true，否则强制零均值。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:154
msgid "Fits a GJR-GARCH(1,1) model by Gaussian maximum likelihood."
msgstr "用高斯极大似然拟合 GJR-GARCH(1,1) 模型。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:157
msgid "Forecasts the conditional variance path of an EGARCH(1,1) fit."
msgstr "预测 EGARCH(1,1) 拟合的条件方差路径。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:157
msgid ""
"The first step uses the last log-variance and standardized residual; later "
"steps use a constant drift and the fitted beta persistence. A result without"
" conditional variances yields a path of NaNs."
msgstr "第一步使用最后一个对数方差与标准化残差；后续步骤使用常数漂移与拟合的 beta 持续性。没有条件方差的结果会产生全 NaN 的路径。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:160
msgid "Estimates the expected shortfall of a return series."
msgstr "估计收益率序列的期望损失。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:160 ../../site/api/risk.md:169
msgid ""
"NaN observations are dropped before estimation, and the index must be "
"strictly ascending and duplicate-free. Historical and EVT methods return a "
"single point estimate and do not use config.horizon; the GARCH method "
"composes the conditional variance forecast over the configured horizon."
msgstr ""
"估计之前丢弃 NaN 观测，且索引必须严格升序且无重复。historical 与 EVT 方法返回单个点估计并且不使用 "
"config.horizon；GARCH 方法在配置的预测期上复合条件方差预测。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:163
msgid "Forecasts the conditional variance path of a GARCH(1,1) fit."
msgstr "预测 GARCH(1,1) 拟合的条件方差路径。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:163
msgid ""
"The first step uses the last conditional variance and residual; later steps "
"use the fitted persistence alpha + beta. A result without conditional "
"variances yields a path of NaNs."
msgstr "第一步使用最后一个条件方差与残差；后续步骤使用拟合的持续性 alpha + beta。没有条件方差的结果会产生全 NaN 的路径。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:166
msgid "Forecasts the conditional variance path of a GJR-GARCH(1,1) fit."
msgstr "预测 GJR-GARCH(1,1) 拟合的条件方差路径。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:166
msgid ""
"The first step uses the last conditional variance and signed residual; later"
" steps use the fitted persistence alpha + 0.5 * gamma + beta. A result "
"without conditional variances yields a path of NaNs."
msgstr ""
"第一步使用最后一个条件方差与带符号残差；后续步骤使用拟合的持续性 alpha + 0.5 * gamma + beta。没有条件方差的结果会产生全 "
"NaN 的路径。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:169
msgid "Estimates the value at risk of a return series."
msgstr "估计收益率序列的在险价值。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:172
msgid "Fits a GARCH-family model and forecasts its variance path."
msgstr "拟合 GARCH 家族模型并预测其方差路径。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:175
msgid "Returns the Gaussian GARCH(1,1) log-likelihood for fixed parameters."
msgstr "返回给定参数下的高斯 GARCH(1,1) 对数似然。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:175
msgid ""
"The first conditional variance is the population variance of eps and the "
"likelihood sums over the remaining observations, so the first observation is"
" a one-step burn-in."
msgstr "首个条件方差取 eps 的总体方差，似然在其余观测上累加，因此第一个观测作为一步预热被舍弃。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:178
msgid "Fits a generalized extreme-value distribution to block extremes."
msgstr "对分块极值拟合推广极值分布。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:178
msgid ""
"NaN values are dropped; each complete block contributes its maximum for "
"upper or the negated minimum for lower, so the fitted location and scale are"
" in tail-magnitude units. The default block size is the integer square root "
"of the remaining observation count."
msgstr ""
"丢弃 NaN 值；每个完整分块对 upper 贡献其最大值、对 lower "
"贡献其最小值取负，因此拟合的位置与尺度以尾部幅值为单位。默认分块大小为剩余观测数的整数平方根。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:181
msgid "Fits a generalized Pareto distribution to tail exceedances."
msgstr "对尾部超出值拟合推广 Pareto 分布。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:181
msgid ""
"Magnitudes are reflected losses for lower and gains for upper; the default "
"threshold is the 90th linear percentile of those magnitudes. At least ten "
"strict exceedances are required. The maximum-likelihood path reproduces the "
"pinned source objective and bounds, which can drive xi to its upper bound. "
"The PWM path uses L-moment formulas."
msgstr ""
"lower 幅值为亏损取反，upper 幅值为收益；默认阈值为这些幅值的第 90 "
"线性百分位。至少需要十个严格超出值。极大似然路径复现固定版本源实现的目标函数与边界，可能把 xi 推到其上界。PWM 路径使用 L 矩公式。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:184
msgid "Estimates the Hill tail index from the selected tail magnitudes."
msgstr "由所选尾部幅值估计 Hill 尾部指数。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:184
msgid ""
"Magnitudes are reflected losses for lower and gains for upper; the default "
"threshold is the 90th linear percentile of those magnitudes. Only strict "
"exceedances are used, and at least ten are required."
msgstr "lower 幅值为亏损取反，upper 幅值为收益；默认阈值为这些幅值的第 90 线性百分位。只使用严格超出值，且至少需要十个。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:187
msgid "Returns the Kupiec proportion-of-failures likelihood-ratio statistic."
msgstr "返回 Kupiec 失败比例似然比统计量。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:187
msgid ""
"The expected exception probability is 1 - confidence_level. The statistic is"
" clamped at zero and is zero when observations is zero."
msgstr "预期突破概率为 1 - confidence_level。统计量下限截断为零，observations 为零时结果为零。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:190
msgid "Returns the lowercase name of a backtest status."
msgstr "返回回测状态的小写名称。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:193
msgid "Returns the lowercase name of a forecast target."
msgstr "返回预测目标的小写名称。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:196
msgid "Returns the lowercase name of a distribution tail."
msgstr "返回分布尾部的小写名称。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:199
msgid "Validates a model specification against the supported contract."
msgstr "依据受支持的契约校验模型设定。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:202
msgid "Returns the lowercase name of a walk-forward status."
msgstr "返回滚动前向状态的小写名称。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:205
msgid "Runs a rolling-window walk-forward VaR backtest."
msgstr "运行滚动窗口的滚动前向 VaR 回测。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:205
msgid ""
"The first forecast is produced for the observation after the initial "
"spec.window; refits occur at that point and every spec.refit_cadence steps, "
"each using exactly the preceding window. Normal forecasts use the mean plus "
"the sample deviation times the normal quantile, falling back to the mean on "
"zero deviation; historical forecasts use the type-6 (Weibull) quantile. The "
"resulting path is backtested at a 0.05 significance level. A path requires "
"forecast_target='var', tail='lower', sign_convention='losses_negative' and "
"horizon=1; a horizon above 1, another target, tail or sign convention, or a "
"historical rank (window + 1) * (1 - confidence_level) outside [1, window] up"
" to floating-point tolerance returns unsupported with a reason."
msgstr ""
"第一个预测针对初始 spec.window 之后的观测产生；此后每 spec.refit_cadence 步重新拟合并恰好使用前一个窗口。normal "
"预测使用均值加样本标准差乘以正态分位数，偏差为零时回退为均值；historical 预测使用第 6 类（Weibull）分位数。得到的路径按 0.05 "
"显著性水平回测。路径要求 "
"forecast_target='var'、tail='lower'、sign_convention='losses_negative' 且 "
"horizon=1；若 horizon 大于 1、目标/尾部/符号约定不符，或在浮点容差内历史秩 (window + 1) * (1 - "
"confidence_level) 落在 [1, window] 之外，则返回带原因的 unsupported。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:208
msgid "Sign-convention label stating that losses are negative returns."
msgstr "表示亏损为负收益率的符号约定标签。"

#: ../../site/api/risk.md:211
msgid "Schema version emitted by risk validation reports."
msgstr "风险验证报告输出的模式版本。"

